 or practical snippets, use `microsoft_code_sample_search`.\\r\\n3. If deeper or complete information is needed, use `microsoft_docs_fetch`.\\r\\n\\r\\n**Search gives breadth. Code Sample Search gives practical examples. Fetch gives depth.**\\r\\n\\r\\nAll content comes from Microsoft Learn or official sources, returned in clean markdown format.\"), meta: None })"}
