    "description": "Lists all active PowerShell sessions.\n* Returns information about all currently running PowerShell sessions.\n* Useful for discovering shellIds to use with read_powershell, or stop_powershell.\n* Shows shellId, command, mode, PID, status, and whether there is unread output.",
    "title": "List shells",
