    "name": "enghub-resolve_service",
    "namespacedName": "enghub/resolve_service",
    "source": "mcp",
    "title": "resolve_service",
    "description": "Resolve a service/team/org name to its ServiceTree GUID and hierarchy level.\n\nCall this FIRST to obtain IDs needed by other tools. Searches all hierarchy levels:\nDivision, Organization, ServiceGroup, TeamGroup, Service.\n\nModes:\n- myServicesOnly=false (default): search full ServiceTree by name.\n- myServicesOnly=true: filter user's own services (admin/owner). Pass query=\"\" for all.\n\n**IMPORTANT - ID Type Distinction:**\nServiceTree IDs (returned by this tool) are DIFFERENT from Metadata node GUIDs.\n\nUse returned ServiceTree IDs with:\n- search: scope.serviceIds (Service-level IDs only) for service-scoped search.\n  WARNING: Do NOT use ServiceTree IDs as scope.ancestorId or scope.nodeId.\n  Those parameters expect Metadata node GUIDs, not ServiceTree IDs.\n- get_service_nodes: list content for a specific Service-level ID.\n- get_node_tree: browse children of any hierarchy node.",
    "input_schema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
