    "description": "Post a notable or critical incident insight (Significant or Urgent only).\r\n            Use the importanceLevel field to control routing:\r\n            - Significant: discussion entry + included in the incident's AI summary (notable findings worth surfacing).\r\n            - Urgent: discussion entry + AI summary + bridge data (critical updates bridge participants must see).\r\n            For routine notes / progress updates that should appear only as a discussion entry, use the PostDiscussionEntry tool instead.\r\n            Returns IncidentActionResult status.",
